'''Reverse Royal Grave''' (リバース聖墓, ''Ribāsu Seibo'', '''Reverse Holy Grave''') is the 23rd sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 121st sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
One of the most straightforward [[Zero Legends]] sub-chapters yet. The gimmicks of [[Compliance Hell]] and [[Wicked Clergyman]] may make you lose the first time trying them, but otherwise the only stage that could pose some challenge is [[Lively Spirits]], which has [[Commander Ostromeda]] followed by a timed [[Oldstrich]].

