==Trivia==
*Although it was officially translated as "Reverse", リバース ''Ribāsu'' can also mean "Rebirth", which may correlate with the [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] and [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]] in some of the stages.
*[[Heavenly Harassment]] may be a reference to the song "[https://youtu.be/bRA71EsgJqg Kamisama Harassment]" (神様ハラスメント, "God Harassment") by [[wikipedia:ja:THE BINARY|THE BINARY]].
*[[Wicked Clergyman]] may be a reference to "[[wikipedia:The Evil Clergyman|The Evil Clergyman]]", a short story by [[wikipedia:H. P. Lovecraft|H. P. Lovecraft]].

